// A node is a conversation the game starts by name. This one is `start.hello`.
// Everything up to the next line starting with == belongs to it.

== start.hello
// Dialogue: the speaker's ID, a colon, then what they say.
guide: Hello! This is your first Pibbles story.

// A pose in brackets changes how the speaker looks, until it changes again.
guide (happy): Lines without a speaker are narration, like the next one.
The guide waves.

// A choice. Each -> is an option, and the indented lines under it run when it's picked.
-> Tell me more
    @set $asked_for_help = true
    guide: The writer's guide covers everything a story can do.
-> Goodbye
    guide: See you soon!

// After an option's lines, the story continues here, below the whole choice.
guide (neutral): That's all for now.
